---
description: Push to origin/main after completing implementation work on this site
alwaysApply: true
---

When you finish a task that changes files in this repository:

1. Commit with a clear message (user does not need to ask separately).
2. Push to `origin main` unless the user says not to push or only asked a question with no code changes.
3. Report the commit hash after a successful push.

Do not force-push. Do not push secrets or credential files.
